<title>ITALY: ATHLETICS-SEVILLE AWARDED 1999 WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-SEVILLE AWARDED 1999 WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish city of Seville was chosen to host the 1999 world athletics championships on Thursday.</p>
<p>The International Amateur Athletic Federation selected Seville over three other candidates - Helsinki, New Delhi and Stanford in California.</p>
<p>This year's world championships are in Athens in August.</p>
</text>
